fo3;"><span style="font-family:Wingdings;mso-fareast-font-family:Wingdings;mso-bidi-font-family:Wingdings;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore;"> §<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">   </span></span></span>Monthly payroll </p><h4>Filter Layout for Payroll</h4><p class="MsoNormal"> In this field, the user has to select the filter layout for payroll. </p><h2 style="mso-list:l4 level2 lfo1;"><a id="_Toc478138465"><span style="mso-fareast-font-family:Cambria;mso-fareast-theme-font:major-latin;mso-bidi-font-family:Cambria;mso-bidi-theme-font:major-latin;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore;">1.24</span></span>Leave Planner </a></h2><h3>Description</h3><p class="MsoNormal"><b style="mso-bidi-font-weight:normal;">Leave Planner</b> is a screen in Leaves module where the user can plan the employees leave to be taken at a time. </p><p class="MsoNormal"> In this group, the user has the option of selecting either of the radio buttons to apply the leave planner. </p><p class="bullets" style="mso-list:l6 level1 lfo2;"><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore;"> ·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">         </span></span></span>All leave Types </p><p class="MsoNormal"> When this option is selected, the application will apply the default leave planner to all the leave components. </p><p class="bullets" style="mso-list:l6 level1 lfo2;"><span style="font-family:Symbol;mso-fareast-font-family:Symbol;mso-bidi-font-family:Symbol;font-weight:normal;"><span style="mso-list:Ignore;"> ·<span style="font:7.0pt &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">         </span></span></span>Selected Leave Type </p><p class="MsoNormal"> When this option is selected, the application will apply the default leave planner to the selected leave component only. </p>',21)),e("p",Cys,[s(c,null,{default:u(()=>o[40]||(o[40]=[v(" ")])),_:1})])])])])}}},wys={key:1,style:{"min-height":"100% !important"}}